ip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Childhood friend of the main character, born from a long line of exorcists."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been an exorcist along with the main character from a very young age."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As an exorcist she is not as powerful as the main character, but an unexpected development gave her the position of Boss, and unknown to her, earned her the hatred of the main character."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has an honest, but simplistic personality, and she is one of the few characters that thinks of Yamato as a cool person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is inferior to Yamato in many points as an exorcist,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"but in regular life she spares no effort to take care of him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7547"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師の家系に生まれた主人公の幼馴染。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と共に幼い頃から陰陽師として過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師としては主人公に負けてしまうが、ひょんなことから陰陽師の元締となり、飛鳥の知らない所で主人公の恨みを買ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はよく言えば実直、悪く言えば単純で、主人公の行動をかっこいいと思う数少ない人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師としては主人公に助けられることが多いが、普段の生活では甲斐甲斐しく主人公の世話を焼いている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10518","sourceWorkId":"14978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師の家系に生まれた主人公の幼なじみ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と共に幼い頃から陰陽師として過ごしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師としては主人公に劣るも、ひょんなことから陰陽師の元締となり、飛鳥の知らないところで主人公の恨みを買ってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格はよく言えば実直、悪く言えば単純で、主人公をかっこいいと思う数少ない人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師としては主人公に助けられることが多いが、普段の生活では甲斐甲斐しく主人公の世話を焼いている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62218"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"90 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10518","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10518","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10518","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/95/95f1bd85f7d1c54f7f43f880add68720067059730febaadc096e5279444138fa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/42cb099c841239beb645e845c7a3c6a5af64f1d32494aae23a4797e50d986448.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"山川琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1173","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1173","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1173","name":"山川 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:50379:62218:4799:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7548","characterName":"碓氷 ゆきひ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62219","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"50379"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10519"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7548"},"originalCharacterName":"碓氷 ゆきひ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"93"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"94"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A half-breed born from a Yuki-onna and a human."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she has human blood in her veins, she has not been miniaturized unlike other demons."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She attends school and hides her demon identity so that exorcists do not become aware of her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is an arrogant character that lives for her own whims, and toying with people is her reason to live."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A beautiful girl with a bewitching aura on her at all times, she has captured the heart of the boys in the school with her seductive smile."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of this, many boys have tried to ask her out, but Yukihi has no interest in them:"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"with words that pierce their hearts with deadly accuracy, they all have fallen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7548"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪女と人間の間に生まれたハーフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の血が混じっているので、他の妖怪とは違い小型化していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師にばれないように、妖怪であることを隠して学園に通っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人を弄ぶことを生きがいとしていて、そのためにはわがままを突き通す傍若無人な人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖艶な雰囲気を常に纏っていて、誘うような笑みで学園の男達の人気を博している美女である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、多数の男子生徒に言い寄られるが、ゆきひにその気はなく、相手の精神を的確にえぐるような言葉を使って玉砕している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10519","sourceWorkId":"14978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪女と人間の間に生まれたハーフ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人間の血が混じっているので、他の妖怪とは違って小型化していない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"陰陽師にばれないように、妖怪であることを隠して生活している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖艶な雰囲気を常に纏っていて、誘うような笑みで学園の男たちの人気を博している美女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"わがままで人を弄ぶことが好きな性格で、言い寄ってくる男子の精神を的確にえぐるような言葉を使って玉砕している。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62219"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"93 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10519","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"94 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10519","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10519","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7dc830027555dde5cc639322abfb577b0eaec6df45c826e53c96e896ca6afabb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/53/531aecc599f4b128d4ea51a569db09839f50bb220caf66c4b4e6725b2dee88a0.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"いのくちゆか","creatorId":"vndb:s590","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s590","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s590","name":"いのくち ゆか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:50379:62219:4490:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7549","characterName":"葛木 藍里","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62220","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"50379"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10520"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7549"},"originalCharacterName":"葛木 藍里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student that attends the same school as the main character and his friends, and his junior by one year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A paparazzi belonging to the Newspaper Club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A very curious girl, she is always on the look for interesting things - or rather, article material,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"and she does not think twice of committing less-than-legal acts like sneaking into the school at night for a scoop."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is known in school for prowling in many places in search of a story."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A bright, high spirited girl, she gets along with people without regard for their age,"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"and so she is popular with almost everyone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been friends with Kusakabe Shiori since they were children, and drags her along everywhere."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7549"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達の学校に通っている生徒で、主人公から見て1学年下の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新聞部に所属しているパパラッチ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心が強く、常におもしろいこと(ネタ)を探していて、ネタの為なら夜の学校に侵入する等、犯罪紛いな行動も厭わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなネタ探しのために様々な所を駆け回っているので、学園でもその名は知られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい言動や高いテンション、年齢も気にしないような人懐っこい性格をしているので、ほぼ万人に受けがいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日下部栞とは子供の頃からの付き合いで、よく栞を連れまわしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10520","sourceWorkId":"14978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちの学園に通っている学生で、主人公から見て一学年下の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新聞部に所属していて、好奇心が強く、常におもしろいことを探していて、ネタのためなら夜の学園に侵入する等、犯罪まがいな行動も厭わない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ネタ探しのために様々な所を駆け回っているので、学園でも名を知られている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るい言動や高いテンション、人懐っこい性格をしているので、万人に受けがいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"日下部栞とは子供の頃からの付き合いで、よく栞を連れまわしている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62220"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10520","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10520","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10520","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f7/f72280631339e0291e59a943b07d1e55a5f975b9572d2f48702c266d2938872f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e1/e122eb17145295419cae4fe0fdebae0a2f37398d20451b34ff332680ec77f661.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岩村琴美","creatorId":"vndb:s1172","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1172","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1172","name":"岩村 琴美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:50379:62220:4813:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c7550","characterName":"日下部 栞","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"62221","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"50379"}],"egsCharacterIds":["10521"],"vndbCharacterId":"c7550"},"originalCharacterName":"日下部 栞","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"89"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"53"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A student that attends the same school as the main character and his friends, and his junior by one year."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a shy, bashful girl, of the type that makes one want to protect her with bravery and courage."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She relies on those people she is used to, but she is so anxious about strangers she can barely talk with people she does not know well."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has trouble saying what she means, but she has a good grip on her thoughts and ponders things thoroughly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves books and is a fountain of knowledge, having read everything from light novels to the Kojien itself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She looks young, but her breasts are large, and still manages to attract the gaze of men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because of this, she loves to imagine she is something like a princess from a fairy tale, who has a hard time dealing with men."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has been close friends with Airi since they were young, so she can speak with her in a friendly tone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She usually ends up entangled in Airi's reckless schemes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c7550"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公達の学校に通っている生徒で、主人公から見て1学年下の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は内気で恥ずかしがり屋、健気で守ってあげたくなるようなタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"慣れた人には甘えるが、あまり親しくない人とは話せない人見知りなところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"伝えることは苦手としているが、自分の考えはしっかりと持っており、色々と思案している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、本が好きでラノベから広辞苑まで幅広く読んでいて知識が豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見た目は幼いが、胸が大きいので、どうしても男の視線が集まってしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため、男に対して苦手意識を持っていて、物語の中の王子様のようなタイプを理想としている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"藍里とは幼い頃からの親友で、砕けた口調で話す。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"後先考えない藍里に巻き込まれるような役回りをしている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10521","sourceWorkId":"14978","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公たちの学園に通っている学生で、主人公から見て一学年下の後輩。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は内気で恥ずかしがり屋、健気で守ってあげたくなるようなタイプ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小柄だが、胸が大きくスタイルがいい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"慣れた人物には世話を焼くが、あまり親しくない人とは話せない、人見知りなところがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"藍里とは幼い頃から仲が良く、後先考えない藍里によく巻き込まれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"62221"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10521","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10521","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"53 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"10521","sourceWorkId":"14978","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date